Open MongoDB Shell

Press Windows + R

Type:

mongosh


Press Enter

Press Enter again to connect

You should see:

test>

4️⃣ STEP-BY-STEP OPERATIONS (TYPE EXACTLY)

First, switch to database:

use collegeDB


Make sure collection has data:


db.students.insertMany([
  { name: "Lohitha", roll: 4, branch: "CSE" },
  { name: "Anu", roll: 102, branch: "IT" },
  { name: "Khushil", roll: 103, branch: "ECE" },
  { name: "Varun", roll: 101, branch: "MEC" }
])


db.students.find()

🔹 1. COUNT Operation
Count total documents:
db.students.countDocuments()


📌 Output:

4

🔹 2. LIMIT Operation
Display only 2 documents:
db.students.find().limit(2)


📌 Output:

Only first 2 documents shown

🔹 3. SORT Operation
Sort by roll number (ascending):
db.students.find().sort({ roll: 1 })

Sort by roll number (descending):
db.students.find().sort({ roll: -1 })

🔹 4. SKIP Operation
Skip first 2 documents:
db.students.find().skip(2)

🔹 5. COMBINATION (VERY IMPORTANT FOR EXAM)
Skip 1, then show 2:
db.students.find().skip(1).limit(2)
